      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can\u0027t this result in a deadlock with `rewrap()`? If one thread enters `rewrap()`, and acquires the wrap\u0027s `inner.lock`, and then another thread enters `acquire_ownership()`, and acquires the same wrap\u0027s `state.lock`, and the wrap is available, they\u0027ll both be waiting on each other to release locks that they hold.",
